\": \"the number of HPV-associated cancers was multiplied by the percentage of each cancer type attributable to HPV, based on previous genotyping studies\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 2\", \"q\": \"HPV-negative estimates were the difference of the total count and the HPV-attributable estimates.\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 2\", \"q\": \"Estimates were rounded to the nearest 10\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}